xtras/8bb336e9ef90c837cad0cf61ef21fc66.mp4?t=1768389555\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146610/extras/c1aa9d33a921d8303e877c30a6fa5a29.webp?t=1768389555\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146610/extras/c1aa9d33a921d8303e877c30a6fa5a29.poster.avif?t=1768389555\" class=\"bb_img\" width=780 height=392 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146610/extras/4021a170736213d7752ea936d1c82c3a.avif?t=1768389555\" width=700 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A corporate slave walking the night streets, clinging to his only joy—</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">his phone, snatched away in an instant by a dark shadow!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Then comes a mocking whisper, calling itself the “Kami of Serendipity”:</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">“...Do you wish to meet a girl?”</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A white rabbit bound by a red thread lures you through a strange torii.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A flash of light, a world collapsing—</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">When you awaken, you find yourself in a cold, unfamiliar place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">And there... a blood-stained girl, pained and alone.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">—Will you dare to reach out your hand?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Every choice you make will rewrite the fate within “Shadow of Memory”.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Can you truly lead them to the “Other Shore”?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146610/extras/c14160f1612888d8ed70b1245d745478.avif?t=1768389555\" width=700 height=150 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Spirit Ofuda: Break the Curse</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Combine word cards freely and unlock endless puzzle possibilities!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146610/extras/f95feddb21c7e617b936e08af51bf384.poster.avif?t=1768389555\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146610/extras/f95feddb21c7e617b936e08af51bf384.webm?t=1768389555\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146610/extras/f95feddb21c7e617b936e08af51bf384.mp4?t=1768389555\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Variety of Mini-Games</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Mini-games that aren’t so “mini” — test your reflexes and wits!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146610/extras/193888ec5325dde95fc6e9ad3489fba0.poster.avif?t=1768389555\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146610/extras/193888ec5325dde95fc6e9ad3489fba0.webm?t=1768389555\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146610/extras/193888ec5325dde95fc6e9ad3489fba0.mp4?t=1768389555\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Adorable Girls Come to Life</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Cat-eared, fox-eared, and bunny-eared girls — their lively gazes and twitching ears never stop moving♡</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146610/extras/5a38bebf67d8b781e6ec464afd7de301.poster.avif?t=1768389555\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146610/extras/5a38bebf67d8b781e6ec464afd7de301.webm?t=1768389555\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146610/extras/5a38bebf67d8b781e6ec464afd7de301.mp4?t=1768389555\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Diverse Cast, Intertwined Fates</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A clumsy but caring older sister, a timid yet brave girl, a bratty little girl who calls herself a god, and a graceful, devoted young wife—</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You will meet them, accompany them, and make choices that shape their destinies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asset